        "TileImage": "$($repository 9d4e194d-67e5-48a6-819e-172556f40157).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome, 47 to Bangkok, where two of your targets are located. The first one is Mrs. Mookjai. She is a manager of the &quot;Himmapan&quot; hotel. Mrs. Mookjai has helped Dexy to hide the mystery of the previous deaths show on Tv. Your next target is of course, Dexy Barat. A Jordan&apos; boss that has also commited a murder but didn&apos;t really told anyone. Dexy is waiting for an exterminator to clean the penthouse on the left wing, but you can bait so she would come to the atrium and you would poison her. Bye!",
